{
  "summary": "The experiment tested a foundational multimodal approach using PCA and ResNet50 encoders with concatenation fusion, aiming to assess modality combination's impact on performance. Validation accuracy of 0.5266 and F1 of 0.5104 suggest moderate baseline performance, though no direct comparison to single-modality baselines exists. The effectiveness of this configuration relative to alternatives remains uncertain without comparative evidence."
}

